exports[`renderRequestEmail snapshots > MD Maryland, initial, both 1`] = `
"Subject: Opt-out and deletion request (KR-7K3M9Q)

Hello Acme Marketing Data privacy team,

I ask you to:
- stop selling or sharing my personal information
- delete the personal information you hold about me

I live in Maryland. Under the Maryland Online Data Privacy Act of 2024 (Md. Code, Com. Law 14-4601 et seq.), I have the right to opt out of the sale of my personal information and to have my personal information deleted. I ask you to honor this request under that law, to the extent it applies to you.

Details to find my records:
Name: Jordan Q Example
Email: jordan@example.org

Opting out of sale does not need proof of my identity. Please do not ask for ID, an account, or a fee for it.
If you need to verify me before deleting, tell me which detail you need and why. I will decide whether to send it.

Please confirm in writing within 45 days of receiving this email. If you need the extra time the law allows, tell me inside that period and say why.
Please keep KR-7K3M9Q in the subject of your reply so I can match it.

Thank you,
Jordan Q Example
jordan@example.org
"
`;

