"Subject: Opt-out and deletion request (KR-7K3M9Q)

Hello Acme Marketing Data privacy team,

I ask you to:
- stop selling or sharing my personal information
- delete the personal information you hold about me

I live in Oregon. Under the Oregon Consumer Privacy Act (Or. Rev. Stat. 646A.570 to 646A.589), I have the right to opt out of the sale of my personal information and to have my personal information deleted. I ask you to honor this request under that law, to the extent it applies to you.

Details to find my records:
